# Scenario 'browser_brl': ホームページ, the page 'brl_list' (brl_list.html): `<ul><li>a<br clear=left>b</ul>`: a <br clear=left> inside a list. Inside a list the line indent is not 0, the test of that handler (the cursor x against hViewX) never succeeds and it
# retries forever (Html_Tag_Br_ClearLeft 74:4BF4 -> Html_Tag_Br_ClearRetry 74:4C5F): the screen stays blank, the buttons pressed afterwards do not leave it.  Controls: 'browser_brc' (the same tags outside a list, and clear=right inside one).
